            "review_title": "Review at Pho Quyen",
            "review_text": "Khoi N\nWashington DC, District of Columbia5073 contributions\n0\nAwesome pho spot\nJan 2019 • Friends\nVery popular pho spot. They have the traditional thin cut beef, brisket and chicken. Place is great for small parties and right off the main Street. Food comes out really quickly and this spot is really clean. I would say this restaurant is more Western and modernized as well. Taste is good and pho ranks high above the rest in the area\nWritten January 21, 2019",
